# Build outputs — the APK is the deliverable, not source. Rebuild with:
#
#   cd android && bubblewrap build --skipPwaValidation
#
# See README.md for the one-time toolchain setup. The Gradle project itself IS
# tracked: Bubblewrap can regenerate it from twa-manifest.json, but doing so
# re-downloads the launcher icons from kana.rjp.io, so committing app/src keeps
# a clean checkout buildable even when the site is unreachable.
*.apk
*.apk.idsig
*.aab

# Gradle scratch.
.gradle/
build/
local.properties

# Regenerated by `bubblewrap update`; tracking it just creates diff noise.
manifest-checksum.txt
